        "table_md": "| Bytes | Description |\n|:---|:---|\n| | **Enable Event (ENEV)**: This field specifies whether an entry shall be added to the Predictable Latency Event Aggregate log page for the associated event. If a bit is set to '1', then an entry shall be added if the specified event occurs. If a bit is cleared to '0', then an entry shall not be added if the specified event occurs. |\n| | | \n| | | \n| 01:00 | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | | \n| | 